# Battlefield FDE Nexus Gateway (`battlefield-fde-nexus`)

High-performance, edge-native telemetry gateway & AI service orchestration hub built on Cloudflare Workers and D1 SQL persistence.

## 🌟 Key Features

- **Cyberpunk Dashboard UI**: Real-time System Status terminal, dynamic latency line charts, and service navigation links.
- **Edge Telemetry Collector**: Captures client metrics (`hardwareConcurrency`, screen resolution, dwell time, IP, geolocation).
- **D1 Analytics Persistence**: Asynchronous session logging and non-blocking database heartbeats using SQLite `UPSERT` logic.
- **Interactive Command Terminal**: Supports query commands (`help`, `logs`, `status`, `whoami`) directly from the browser interface.
- **REST Telemetry APIs**:
  - `POST /api/telemetry/heartbeat` - Live session heartbeats.
  - `GET /api/telemetry/analytics` - Aggregated session and city distribution metrics.
  - `GET /api/health-check` - Real-time edge service health diagnostics.

